OL,3,GNEWSADelivery robots removed from
OL,4,Astreets as pilot ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FSelf-driving food delivery robots have
OL,7,Fbeen taken off the streets after the
OL,8,Foperator called time on a pilot scheme
OL,9,Fafter just five months.
OL,11,FThe six-wheeled machines were launched
OL,12,Fin parts of Sheffield by Starship
OL,13,FTechnologies in March in partnership
OL,14,Fwith Uber Eats.
OL,16,FDuring the short trial the foot-high
OL,17,Fvehicles kept getting their visibility
OL,18,Fflags snapped off and some were sprayed
OL,19,Fwith graffiti, as well as attracting
OL,20,Fcomplaints that they "got in the way"
OL,21,Fof pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
