OL,3,GNEWSADelivery robots removed from
OL,4,Astreets as pilot ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FStarship Technologies said it had
OL,7,F"paused" the service as its pilot
OL,8,Fscheme had come to a "natural" end, but
OL,9,Finsisted the vandalism did not affect
OL,10,Fthe decision to stop.
